  (text "Buck XL4005: input VBUS_SYS (adapter / OTG BQ25713), tegangan diatur MCU" (at 44.45 58.42 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.032 2.032) (thickness 0.4064) bold (color 0 0 194 1)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "d70ba286-fee2-5703-91d7-b84e0a80f17c")
  )
  (text "Cara kerja:\n- Input = VBUS_SYS. Adapter tercolok: tegangan adapter (PD 20V).\n  Dari baterai: MCU menyalakan OTG BQ25713, VBUS_SYS = Vout + 2V (maks 20.8V).\n- MCU mengatur tegangan lewat PWM BB_ADJ -> Q401 -> RC (R405/C406) -> R404 ke FB,\n  loop tertutup memakai VOUT_SENSE. Pilihan tegangan dari DIP + APPLY (sheet MCU).\n- Fail-safe: EN default LOW (R401); PWM LOW / MCU mati -> Vout minimum (~1V).\n- Saat USB-C jadi source, VBUS_SYS = tegangan PD -> Vout maks ~ VPD - 2V." (at 30.48 165.1 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.52 1.52)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "3d9c476d-38b2-574a-a681-e2fda0b5250a")
  )
)
